Supreme People's Court

Decision on the Appointment of 11 Specially Invited Scientific and Technical Consulting Experts Including Ma Guoxin

Fa [2010] No. 174

In order to thoroughly implement the national intellectual property strategy, vigorously promote the construction of an innovation-oriented country, give full play to the important and unique role of scientific and technical experts in the judicial protection of intellectual property, improve the scientific and democratic nature of judicial decision-making in intellectual property, continuously enhance the capacity and level of intellectual property adjudication, earnestly fulfill the leading responsibility of judicial protection of intellectual property, and further increase the credibility of intellectual property adjudication, the Supreme People's Court has decided to appoint the following (listed in order of stroke count of surnames):

Ma Guoxin, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Wang Yuming, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Bai Chunli, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences;
Zuo Tieyong, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Zhu Gaofeng, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Li Guojie, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Du Xiangwan, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Zhao Zhongxian, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences;
Zhong Nanshan, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Yuan Longping, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;
Dai Jingrui, Academician of the Chinese Academy of Engineering;

as the first batch of specially invited scientific and technical consulting experts of the Supreme People's Court, with a term of five years (2010-2014).

April 19, 2010
